// The lawful twin of unknown-medium.zui: one word changed.
//
// `voice` is one of the ten. Nothing else about the declaration moves --
// which is the point of a twin: it proves the check fires on the medium
// and not on the shape of a VIBE.
//
// Expected: no diagnostics at any level.

DEFINE VIBE operator_voice (
  SURFACE_AS voice,
  MOTION none
)
